{"overview":"پریس کیهیل که روزی در آستانه ستاره شدن در دنیای گلف بود، پس از فروپاشی روحی در زمین مسابقه همه‌چیزش را از دست داد. حالا در حالی که برای ادامه زندگی می‌جنگد، تمام امید و سرمایه‌اش را روی پرورش نوجوانی نابغه به نام سانتی می‌گذارد؛ مسیری که می‌تواند معنای تازه‌ای به زندگی او ببخشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Pryce Cahill was headed for golf greatness when an on-course meltdown derailed his career. Now struggling to stay afloat, he goes all in to mentor Santi—a teenage phenom with immense potential—and maybe save himself.","tagline_en":"Take another swing.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/fU3vgSKLnlTS8fOXRDcgyj1aYco.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/edst6eo9uDk8bs1c7BzAMgA8PsZ.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":["جیسون کلر"],"crew_en":["Jason Keller"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"اوون ویلسون","role":"Pryce Cahill","photo":"/5A46lNOwmpX77jAdhyKxU7e2Hub.jpg","en":"Owen Wilson"},{"name":"Peter Dager","role":"Santi","photo":"/iYo3oUqaWcrQizMFPyWJtlW8xrT.jpg"},{"name":"Lilli Kay","role":"Zero","photo":"/21wRVVOMT3eQnLCioxxOnPD4r60.jpg"},{"name":"ماریانا تروینو","role":"Elena","photo":"/4pSXXgiK0AtJA9JyF3Vc43Tcqug.jpg","en":"Mariana Treviño"},{"name":"مارک مارون","role":"Mitts","photo":"/xzRBK8hR6693VQWmr3Wx2UVoA5P.jpg","en":"Marc Maron"},{"name":"ریا سیهورن","role":"","photo":"/tql4gvY8NfYvmAdmdp1olkwJnrq.jpg","en":"Rhea Seehorn"}],"trailer":"72oB_zVF_6o","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/248830-stick/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Apple TV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/9icYBfYFcwgCbky5VdGUIKJ4C5i.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rerVCu9auZrgxTTiZu1criqrQzg.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/248830-stick/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Apple TV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/9icYBfYFcwgCbky5VdGUIKJ4C5i.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rerVCu9auZrgxTTiZu1criqrQzg.png"}]},"CA":{"link":